      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eitobira Haman pee eidaikie Ilyahudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi kuna baa, neilepie olaiguanani Serser Haman le Agag, olayioni le Hamedata, neisho ninye enkitoo nepik olorika lenye shumata ile lelo kituaak ooboitare ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore laisiaayiak pooki lo laiguanani ootii kishomi neirrugo aaisho Haman enkanyit; amu neijia apa eitanapishe olaiguanani ajo. Kake eitu eirrugo Mordekai arashu aitodolu enkanyit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki lelo aisiaayiak lo laiguanani ootii kishomi Mordekai, “Kainyoo pee igil enkitanapata o laiguanani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee eirorie ninche ninye anaake neany ening ninche, neliki ninche Haman, ejo pee edol tenaa kepal Mordekai nena, amu etiaaka ninye ninche nchere Olyahudi ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee edol Haman ajo eitu eirrugo Mordekai arashu eitodolu enkanyit negoro oleng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake eitu ejo aar Mordekai aa ninye ake. Amu eitayioloki ninye iltung'ana pooki le Mordekai, neing'oru Haman pee ear Ilyahudi pooki, iltung'ana le Mordekai, te nkitoria pooki e Serser.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore to lapa le dukuya, laa ninye olapa le Nisan, to lari le tomon oare lo laiguanani Serser, neosh ninche Pura nchere enkukuo te dukuya Haman nkolong'i pooki; neosh too lapaitin pooki o metabaiki olapa le tomon oare, laa ninye olapa le Adar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Haman ajoki olaiguanani Serser, “Etii iltung'ana moobo ooisardakari aaorikino atua iltung'ana loo loshon pooki le nkitoria ino; ore nkitanapat enye nepaashare inoo lkulikae tung'ana pooki, nemeibung nkitanapat o laiguanani, metaa metumie olaiguanani dupoto te nepalaa ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te neishiaakino to laiguanani nchoo meigeri enkitanapata pee emuti ninche, naa kalak nanu ntalantani nkalifuni tomon oo mpisai apik nkaik e lelo ooitasheiki esiaai o laiguanani pee eyau aapik atua masaa o laiguanani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitayu olaiguanani olgisoi ashurtu te nkaina enye neisho Haman le Agag ole Hamedata, olmang'atinta loo Lyahudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki olaiguanani Haman, “Kinchooki mpisai, o ltung'ana sii, pee intaas ninche anaa enaishiaakino te iyie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neipoti ilaigerok lo laiguanani te nkolong e tomon ookuni o lapa le dukuya, neigeri anaa enaitanapishe Haman neigerokini lelo ang'eni o lelo kituaak ooitasheiki iloshon, o laitasheikinok pooki loo ltung'ana, olosho ake to rorei lenye o ltung'ana te nkutuk enye; neigeroki apa te nkarna e Serser nepiki olmishire te ilo gisoi lo laiguanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neirriwari mpala too nkaik e lelo ooirriwari meshomo ilkerenketi pooki lo laiguanani, pee eidaikie, neari metuata, neiwuang'ieki Ilyahudi pooki ooti o lbotoro, inkituaak o nkera, te nkolong nabo, te nkolong e tomon ookuni o lapa le tomon oare, laa ninye olapa le Adar, neya imasaa enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa keirriwari empalai e ilo kigeroto iloshon pooki pee eitanapi metolikini iltung'ana pooki meterretenata te ina olong. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepuo lelo ooirriwari aaya mpala te nkisarrisar te nkitanapata o laiguanani, neitayuni ina kitanapata te Susa teina ang kitok. Netoni olaiguanani o Haman aaokisho, kake ore ina ang anasa e Susa neaku enking'asia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
